                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/1150: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-02-15T10:00:00-05:00">February 15, 1933—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 11:50 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>38. Tarapacá occupied 9 this morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
